VALUES ('How to Watch SBS 3D Content on Mobile VR Headsets', 'how-to-watch-sbs-3d-content-on-mobile-vr-headsets', 'VR & AR', 'Complete guide to watching SBS 3D content on smartphone-based VR headsets. Tips for proper alignment, lens adjustment, and best viewing experience.', '<h3>1. Smartphone Compatibility</h3><p>For smartphone-based VR headsets, make sure the headset is compatible with your smartphone before attempting SBS 3D playback.</p><h3>2. Clean the Display</h3><p>If your VR headset requires a smartphone, clean the smartphone display before placing it inside the headset for the best viewing experience.</p><h3>3. Proper Alignment</h3><p>To reduce ghosting and cross-eyed visuals, make sure both images are properly aligned and that each eye only sees its respective image. The left eye should not see the right image, and vice versa. Adjust the headset lenses as needed for comfortable viewing and proper image alignment.</p><h3>4. Find Your Sweet Spot</h3><p>Since every headset is different, viewers are encouraged to experiment with lens adjustments and viewing settings to find their preferred SBS 3D viewing sweet spot.</p><h3>5. Additional Tips</h3><p>Since every headset is different, viewers are encouraged to experiment with lens adjustments and viewing settings to find their preferred SBS 3D viewing sweet spot.</p>', 'https://i.ibb.co/Sw0v4MtT/VR.png', 'Aniket Bhosale', 'June 10, 2026', 'published', '2026-06-27T10:07:02.525471+00:00');
